docs/upstream-manifest.json. Existing copyright and license notices are retained.

Changes in this distribution:
- Replaced Focus application imports with independent immutable wire contracts.
- Narrowed evidence references to conversation messages; Mission and other
  application-specific evidence types remain in the host.
- Preserved source addresses, canonical hashes, schema versions, prompts,
  grounding rules and historical proof serialization.
- Added independent engine orchestration, model/admission/store interfaces,
  in-memory and SQLite adapters, bounded workers and per-attempt receipts.
- Replaced repeated full-message scans in assembly and interpretation inputs
  with message maps; moved eligibility inventory construction outside a loop.
- Added host integration examples, compatibility fixtures and benchmarks.
- Adapted invalid original-read scope checks to structured retry feedback.
- Applied formatting and removed an unused upstream import.
